      "extract": "5. Analyzing Technical Options Defining and Validating System Requirements Guide Whether considering building, enhancing or buying a surveillance system, you must first take the key step of defining your requirements; that is, specifying what you need your system to do to support your work. Whether large or small, every information system needs to enable the work and workflows of the staff doing the work.",
